    Hello everybody,

    I'm modifying the sources to get some new features. Of course I think
   they are great, but before going on I'd like to have some opinions about
   them.

    These are the novelties:

----1. New type of room: a restaurant. It is composed of a chef and a
   restaurant table in the middle. When the hero sits at the table, the
   chef offers you the menu. You just order what you want like a real
   restaurant, and of course you have to pay some bill after getting served.
   Objetive of all this is have a new way of getting intrinsics.

